BEGIN:VEVENT
UID:98b03feb920b0ed1@kidcal
DTSTAMP:20260920T143252Z
DTSTART:20260929T220000Z
DTEND:20260929T230000Z
SUMMARY:Digital Resource Spotlight: Peterson's Test and Career Prep
LOCATION:Masiello Classroom
URL:https://keenenh.libcal.com/event/17178647
CATEGORIES:kids\,Keene Public Library
DESCRIPTION:Did you know your library card gives you free access to powerf
 ul online learning platforms\, skill-building tools\, and interactive data
 bases? Each month\, join us for a step-by-step demonstration of one of our
  featured digital resources. We’ll guide you through setting up an accou
 nt\, navigating the platform\, and making the most of its features for per
 sonal growth or career development. Bring your device to follow along\, or
  just sit back and watch!\n\nThis Month: Peterson's Test and Career Prep p
 repares you for upcoming standardized tests\, like the ACT\, SAT\, AP\, CL
 EP\, etc.\, and your college experience. It also offers in-depth informati
 on on undergraduate and graduate programs\, tuition and scholarship assist
 ance\, and more. Studying for U.S. Citizenship or preparing for the Firefi
 ghter exam? This digital resource has you covered. Plus\, it provides temp
 lates for creating resumés and cover letters.\nSource: Keene Public Libra
 ry
END:VEVENT
BEGIN:VEVENT
UID:00bb456007fe61d4@kidcal
DTSTAMP:20260920T143252Z
DTSTART:20260930T143000Z
DTEND:20260930T151500Z
SUMMARY:Preschool Storytime
LOCATION:Storyroom
URL:https://keenenh.libcal.com/event/17090835
CATEGORIES:kids\,Keene Public Library
DESCRIPTION:Preschool storytimes are geared towards pre-kindergarteners ag
 es 3 to 5\, who can sit and listen to short stories and participate in sim
 ple songs and rhymes. Storytime will always include read-aloud stories and
  fingerplays and may include poems\, music\, dramatic play\, and crafts. \
 n\n \n\nThis is a 7-week series\, which ends the week of November 15th. Wh
 en you sign up for one class\, you will automatically be registered for ea
 ch class in the series.\n\nPLEASE NOTE: We will not meet on Wednesday Nove
 mber 11th in honor of Veterans Day. Our last meeting will be Wednesday Nov
 ember 18th.\nSource: Keene Public Library
END:VEVENT
BEGIN:VEVENT
UID:fd01b1066298d02a@kidcal
DTSTAMP:20260920T143252Z
DTSTART:20261001T143000Z
DTEND:20261001T151500Z
SUMMARY:Book time with Babies and Toddlers
LOCATION:Storyroom
URL:https://keenenh.libcal.com/event/17146447
CATEGORIES:kids\,Keene Public Library
DESCRIPTION:We'll share books\, rhymes\, music\, fun fingerplays\, puppets
 \, and get-up-and-move activities specially designed for infants and toddl
 ers. At the end of the program\, there will be a playtime when parents and
  caregivers share books\, puzzles\, or other early literacy activities wit
 h their toddlers.  This 7 week series ends the week of November 8th.  When
  you sign up for one class\, you will automatically be registered for each
  session in the series.\nSource: Keene Public Library
END:VEVENT
BEGIN:VEVENT
UID:a58c17ea76544f57@kidcal
DTSTAMP:20260920T143252Z
