SUMMARY:Kids STEAM: Plushie Portraits
LOCATION:Kay Fox Room
URL:https://keenenh.libcal.com/event/17654551
CATEGORIES:kids\,Keene Public Library
DESCRIPTION:Kids STEAM has a new day of the week while Miss Scout is out. 
 But join Parker for plenty of activities each month!\n\nCreate a portrait 
