SUMMARY:CLif Year of the Book
LOCATION:Cohen Hall
URL:https://keenenh.libcal.com/event/17155462
CATEGORIES:kids\,Keene Public Library
DESCRIPTION:Author\, Naturalist & Educator extraordinaire Susie Spikol fro
 m the Harris Center for Conservation Education is our special guest for th
 is Children's Literacy Event created in collaboration with Children's Lite
 racy Foundation (CLiF) and Wheelock School. Susie will be reading from her
  recent book and presenting a fun filled interactive presentation on mushr
 ooms!  Wheelock School Librarian Cheri Nutting will be on hand to show off
  all the beautiful new picture books gifted to the school & the Keene Publ
 ic Library through a grant from CLiF. This program is designed for element
 ary age children and families.  Registration is appreciated so we can be s
 ure to be prepared to give you the best experience.\nSource: Keene Public 
 Library
END:VEVENT
