URL:https://keenenh.libcal.com/event/16766980
CATEGORIES:kids\,Keene Public Library
DESCRIPTION:Get information and connect with services through Monadnock Pe
 er Support for recovery services\, mental health and wellness.\n\nMPS is a
  member-driven organization that establishes a culture in which our member
 s and participants feel more empowered to get support from and give suppor
 t to peers. We provide many free services including 30  support groups wee
 kly\, meals\, field trips\, respite stays and more! Visit https://www.mona
 dnockpsa.org/ for more information or chat with a member during tabling.\n
 Source: Keene Public Library
