BEGIN:VEVENT
UID:c9313c4e89b97497@kidcal
DTSTAMP:20260920T143252Z
DTSTART;TZID=America/New_York:20260928T173000
DTEND;TZID=America/New_York:20260928T190000
SUMMARY:Financial Empowerment: Stretching Your Dollar
LOCATION:Meeting Room A – Community Meeting Room\, 224 Main Street\, Bra
 ttleboro\, VT\, 05301\, United States
URL:https://brookslibraryvt.org/event/financial-empowerment-11/
CATEGORIES:kids\,Brooks Memorial Library
DESCRIPTION:Financial Q & A with SEVCA and Mascoma Bank \nAll are welcome 
 to these programs\, held on the 4th Mondays of the month throughout 2026\,
  with different topics for each session and peer support encouraged throug
 hout.  Representatives from SEVCA and Mascoma Bank facilitate the discuss
 ions\, share their expertise\, and respond to individual questions and con
 cerns.  A light meal will be served at 5:30PM\; the focused conversation 
 starts at 6:00 PM. \nSeptember’s Topic is Stretching Your Dollar:  Maki
 ng Every Dollar Go Further.  We will dive into a lively discussion on ide
 as and resources for how to help make your money go further. \nRegistratio
 n is required. To sign-up\, you can call (802-254-5290)\, stop by the circ
 ulation desk\, or email us at circ@brookslibraryvt.org\nSource: Brooks Mem
 orial Library
END:VEVENT
