DTEND;TZID=America/New_York:20261001T170000
SUMMARY:LEGO-Palooza
LOCATION:Meeting Room A – Community Meeting Room\, 224 Main Street\, Bra
 ttleboro\, VT\, 05301\, United States
URL:https://brookslibraryvt.org/event/lego-palooza-5/2026-10-01/
CATEGORIES:kids\,Brooks Memorial Library
DESCRIPTION:Join us on the first Thursday of every month after school from
  3-5pm to play with LEGOs! \nWe provide the LEGOs. You build. Do not bring
  your own LEGOs. \nChildren cannot keep LEGOs\, but if there is enough roo
 m\, we will display them in the window. \nFree and open to the public!\nSo
 urce: Brooks Memorial Library
END:VEVENT
